queues are the sam as real worlds queues, people join from the back
queues are FIFO (first in first out)

we use queues when we want to share some resource on some consumers,
like printers,
     OS (manage processes),
     web server (manage income requests)


all the main functionalities should be O(1)
because we just need First & Last item.
enqueue()           O(1)
dequeue()           O(1)
peek()              O(1)
isEmpty()           O(1)